 night to hold a gala dance and so I would like to invite you all to a masked ball tomorrow evening

302
00:21:46,750 --> 00:21:50,190
 I'm looking forward to seeing you all at our farewell celebration.

303
00:22:01,660 --> 00:22:14,250
 Again, I'm going to teach you a...

304
00:22:14,250 --> 00:22:18,310
 A lesson? A little learning is a dangerous thing.

305
00:22:28,240 --> 00:22:36,000
 Aren't you taking me to the ball?

306
00:22:36,640 --> 00:22:39,270
 Now you will see that I'm not someone who can be ignored.

307
00:22:39,450 --> 00:22:42,130
 Lieutenant, now I am going to put things in order.

308
00:22:42,510 --> 00:22:43,830
 I do regret this.

309
00:22:44,180 --> 00:22:45,310
 Yes, and I regret it too.

310
00:22:54,900 --> 00:23:00,540
 It's open now. Come on, no time to lose.

311
00:23:04,570 --> 00:23:12,630
 Seeing Lieutenant Celia and our young police people from Omega, it's all rather disquieting.

312
00:23:12,770 --> 00:23:15,650
 Oh, by the way, how is our unfortunate friend Captain Harold?

313
00:23:15,650 --> 00:23:16,210
 Sir?

314
00:23:16,210 --> 00:23:19,100
 In a short time, he will be his old self again.

315
00:23:19,100 --> 00:23:31,970
 Me too!

316
00:23:31,970 --> 00:23:54,570
 Thing you're here.

317
00:23:54,570 --> 00:23:56,000
 Couldn't agree more, and now

318
00:23:56,000 --> 00:23:59,260
 introduce my very good friend here.

319
00:23:59,260 --> 00:24:09,420
 He's an imposter!

320
00:24:09,420 --> 00:24:11,550
 Arrest him!

321
00:24:11,550 --> 00:24:21,500
 There is an imposter here, it's you!

322
00:24:21,500 --> 00:24:23,770
 Now that your whole game is unmasked,

323
00:24:23,770 --> 00:24:27,170
 I would suggest that you come along quietly to prevent further trouble.

324
00:24:27,170 --> 00:24:36,170
 Oh, it's nothing, lady. Had to see a man about a dog.

325
00:24:37,020 --> 00:24:42,270
 Do what has to be done, Harold.

326
00:24:42,270 --> 00:24:45,330
 Don't worry, sir. No difficulty now.

327
00:24:45,330 --> 00:24:47,810
 I assure you, we have the situation well in hand.

328
00:24:47,810 --> 00:24:56,190
 And see.

329
00:24:56,190 --> 00:24:58,720
 All those of ours who could get away from that ship.

330
00:24:58,720 --> 00:25:01,680
 You understand? We never meant you any harm.

331
00:25:01,840 --> 00:25:05,950
 You've been easy to arm our troops, but we didn't do it.

332
00:25:06,220 --> 00:25:08,110
 And the Jethro cargo craft, what happened?

333
00:25:08,640 --> 00:25:10,510
 Our group of men became excited.

334
00:25:10,650 --> 00:25:12,490
 They tried to destroy us with explosives.

335
00:25:12,910 --> 00:25:14,350
 You saw the results of that.

336
00:25:14,720 --> 00:25:17,150
 But what's it all for? Why did you do this?

337
00:25:17,630 --> 00:25:19,850
 Seize the Cosmopolitan or the Jethro.

338
00:25:19,970 --> 00:25:20,930
 It was only a test.

339
00:25:21,290 --> 00:25:25,180
 Just to see if we are ready to, to find out if we are your equals yet.

340
00:25:25,680 --> 00:25:28,000
 In any case, there's been great progress.

341
00:25:28,140 --> 00:25:31,180
 And progress will continue until one day we shall triumph.

342
00:25:31,860 --> 00:25:34,390
 Victory today is only a rearguard action.

343
00:25:35,250 --> 00:25:36,200
 Told you everything.

344
00:25:37,220 --> 00:25:38,560
 Request to be left alone.

345
00:25:39,050 --> 00:25:42,090
 On your honor, will you consider yourself under arrest in this room?

346
00:25:42,270 --> 00:25:46,770
 I assure you on my word, I shall do nothing at all to try and get out of this room.

347
00:25:59,280 --> 00:26:05,310
 Wanted to.

348
00:26:06,230 --> 00:26:07,490
 He could have destroyed the whole ship.

349
00:26:08,020 --> 00:26:08,940
 All right, Lieutenant.

350
00:26:09,410 --> 00:26:10,710
 On our way to Omega.

351
00:26:18,310 --> 00:26:29,330
 So wander.

352
00:26:34,210 --> 00:26:37,450
 Come take your place.

353
00:26:37,680 --> 00:26:38,330
 We're leaving.

